    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Please Add Wishilist!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085010/extras/c1ac6dcb0c3d6b67e7c07849a74c8c0d.avif?t=1744796742\" width=600 height=156 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>In the new era, humans embrace AI for communication through thought alone, abandoning traditional keyboards and internet emojis. Keyboard warriors, leading emoji shooters, battle virus-infected internet monsters to protect the last digital sanctuaries.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casino! Roguelike! Tower Defense!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In the game, players face waves of internet monsters;<br></li><li>Players must select appropriate emoji shooters and items to place in formation, which are randomly distributed with a chance to deal high damage.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Props and soldiers are matched in thousands of ways</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two identical soldiers or items on the field can be merged to upgrade to higher quality, creating a unique defense force with a bit of thought.<br></li><li>The myriad combinations of soldiers and items allow endless experimentation with various styles, unlocking rare soldiers and items as battles progress, overturning traditional genres.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMOJI soldiers assemble!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each round of combat allows the purchase of new soldiers and items, with positions randomly rearranged based on the enemy's direction to focus firepower on strong foes.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Internet monster is coming!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There's a chance to purchase legendary items that can significantly enhance combat capabilities, but the cost is great, requiring careful balance in your item combinations.<br></li><li>Of course, clearing the game not only requires great wisdom and cautious strategy but also a bit of &quot;luck&quot;!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In the new era, humans embrace AI for communication through thought alone, abandoning traditional keyboards and internet emojis. Keyboard warriors, leading emoji shooters, battle virus-infected internet monsters to protect the last digital sanctuaries.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casino! Roguelike! Tower Defense!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>In the game, players face waves of internet monsters;<br></li><li>Players must select appropriate emoji shooters and items to place in formation, which are randomly distributed with a chance to deal high damage.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Props and soldiers are matched in thousands of ways</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two identical soldiers or items on the field can be merged to upgrade to higher quality, creating a unique defense force with a bit of thought.<br></li><li>The myriad combinations of soldiers and items allow endless experimentation with various styles, unlocking rare soldiers and items as battles progress, overturning traditional genres.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EMOJI soldiers assemble!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each round of combat allows the purchase of new soldiers and items, with positions randomly rearranged based on the enemy's direction to focus firepower on strong foes.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Internet monster is coming!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There's a chance to purchase legendary items that can significantly enhance combat capabilities, but the cost is great, requiring careful balance in your item combinations.<br></li><li>Of course, clearing the game not only requires great wisdom and cautious strategy but also a bit of &quot;luck&quot;!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A tower defense game with Roguelike and casino elements. Players create diverse decks using Emoji shooters and various items, activating unique traits to defeat meme monsters from the digital world.",
